OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens when a shoplifter is
OL,4,Abrought before the courts?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlcohol, pet food and washing capsules
OL,7,Fare all items he admits stealing from
OL,8,Fshops in Clacton-on-Sea and
OL,9,FHolland-on-Sea in late-2025, to the
OL,10,Ftune of #504.50.
